<title>FINLAND: TURUN ARVOKIINTEISTOT H1 LOSS NARROWS.</title>
<headline>TURUN ARVOKIINTEISTOT H1 LOSS NARROWS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30,</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Loss after fin items			 1.3 vs 5.9 loss</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	loss 0.52 vs 2.39 loss</p>
<p> Net sales					7.1 vs 9.6</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)     19.16 vs 17.39</p>
<p> Operating margin			     5.7 vs 7.7</p>
<p> Operating profit			     3.4 vs 5.3</p>
<p> Net financial costs			  4.6 vs 11.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish investment company is Turun</p>
<p>Arvokiinteistot Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0248</p>
